// Title: Reg Mod Rdp
// Description: Hunts for reg mod rdp
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1021.001, T1112
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Software install/update yang sah memodifikasi registry.
RegistryEvents | where RegistryKey contains 'Terminal Server' and RegistryValueName == 'fDenyTSConnections'
